{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishbait</strong> is a reverse fishing card game where you play as a fish trying to avoid getting caught by the fisherman. Play online with up to 4 players and battle it out in a chaotic game of hoarding, stealing, and survival. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/1ac2f3d272a94e5cbf8dc7830b349e8d.avif?t=1758689532\" width=973 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules of the game are simple. Each turn, a player must draw a card. If they draw a &quot;Bait&quot; card, they will lose the game unless they have an &quot;Escape&quot; card on hand that they can use. You can steal another players card, skip your turn, or force other players to take two turns. At end of each round, there will be only 1 fish left alive, and whoever lasts until the end wins the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/96a48100099bdb9efe3b84968fcbaf92.avif?t=1758689532\" width=1175 height=315 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2001860?t=1758689532","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2001860?t=1758689532","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/42f070ecaaaccdf86c37c9425a91493b62dfc0f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758689532","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/42f070ecaaaccdf86c37c9425a91493b62dfc0f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758689532","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"des